## Category: Map
## X-Category: Map
## X-License: GPL-3.0-or-later (the map's drawing and data come from OpenMap, MIT: LICENSES\OpenMap.txt); map art is Blizzard's
## X-Website: https://github.com/Nolween/my-map-is-rich

